# Brand color

The editorial accent is blue.

- Primary blue: `#154C7E`. Token: `--color-accent`.
- Hover and active blue: `#103B63`. Token: `--color-accent-hover`.

Use the accent for section headings, category labels, editorial links, navigation hover and current states, section marks, newsletter separators, and focus outlines.

Keep the masthead wordmark, article headlines, body text, and author names in ink (`#080808`). Keep hairline dividers on the rule color (`#E2E2E2`). Do not fill sections with a blue background.

Do not use crimson, `#D7193F`, or a `--color-crimson` token for editorial elements.

`--color-error` (`#D7193F`) is only for invalid form fields. Status labels stay separate from the brand accent. Do not identify a link, a selected control, or an error by color alone.
